{"id":"07fc415e8971bd48","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Stopped Process","display":"df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process — ZFC Prob2 Stopped Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process — ZFC Prob2 Stopped Process","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process — ZFC Prob2 Stopped Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cef612157cb4ba5d\" href=\"?note=cef612157cb4ba5d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time\">58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S(Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(Y_\\bullet(i)(\\omega)=\\begin{cases}X_\\bullet(\\tau(\\omega))(\\omega),&amp;\\tau(\\omega)\\in I\\land\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I,\\\\X_\\bullet(i)(\\omega),&amp;\\tau(\\omega)\\notin I\\lor\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\notin\\leq_I.\\end{cases}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S(Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(Y_\\bullet(i)(\\omega)=\\begin{cases}X_\\bullet(\\tau(\\omega))(\\omega),&amp;\\tau(\\omega)\\in I\\land\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I,\\\\X_\\bullet(i)(\\omega),&amp;\\tau(\\omega)\\notin I\\lor\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\notin\\leq_I.\\end{cases}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The time order is explicit and the value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> is handled without applying an undefined minimum operation to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(I\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time","status":"resolved","id":"cef612157cb4ba5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}stopped\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppedProcess}_S(Y_\\bullet,X_\\bullet,\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau,\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_\\bullet,I,Y^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(Y_\\bullet(i)(\\omega)=\\begin{cases}X_\\bullet(\\tau(\\omega))(\\omega),&\\tau(\\omega)\\in I\\land\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I,\\\\X_\\bullet(i)(\\omega),&\\tau(\\omega)\\notin I\\lor\\langle\\tau(\\omega),i\\rangle\\notin\\leq_I.\\end{cases}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"I\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1649,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-stopped-process]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","8902399f82dbe8a2","cef612157cb4ba5d"]}